WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.040
Growth is surging.

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:03.340
Manufacturing is booming.

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:06.940
The stock market, as I said, is doing better than

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:08.680
it's ever done.

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:11.540
And all of you in this room benefit by that.

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:13.620
Almost everybody.

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:16.260
And importantly, workers' wages are rising at the

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:20.059
fastest pace in more than 60 years.

00:00:20.059 --> 00:00:22.420
And that's what it's all about, isn't it?

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:26.760
In four years of President Biden, we had less than

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:30.400
$1 trillion of new investment into the

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:31.400
United States.

